The 36 terms known to OEIS, indexed from `1`.

Skeleton generated by `lake exe oeis-gen`; every declaration is a `sorry` placeholder.
-/

namespace A181891

/-- Known terms of `A181891`, starting at index `1`. -/
def data : List retType :=
  [0, 1, 10, 11, 100, 101, 110, 111, 1000, 1001,
    1100, 1101, 10000, 10001, 10100, 10101, 11000, 11001, 11100, 11101,
    100000, 100001, 101100, 101101, 110000, 110001, 111100, 111101, 1000000, 1000001,
